	<string>LankaRide needs your location to track drivers and provide real-time ride services.</string>
	<key>NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>LankaRide needs your location to track drivers and provide real-time ride services.</string>
	<key>NSLocationAlwaysUsageDescription</key>
	<string>LankaRide needs your location to track drivers and provide real-time ride services.</string>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Lanka Ride needs access to your camera to let you take profile pictures.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Lanka Ride needs access to your photo library to let you choose profile pictures.</string>
